## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's mid-tier coding and agentic model inside Kimi Code, with 1M context and efficient reasoning between K2.7 Code and flagship K3.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `moonshot/kimi-k2-8-preview` — see meta.json
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 per vendor docs; knowledge cutoff 2026-03
- **IDs:** `moonshot/kimi-k2-8-preview`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M)
- **Modalities:** Text, image in; text out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Paid $1.50/$6 per 1M preview — note: Kimi membership plan (no per-token billing, no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

