### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 80/100.** Evidence AA Index ~55 preview; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 78/100.** Evidence GPQA ~85% preview; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 98/100.** 1,048,576 (1M) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 65/100.** Text, image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 82/100.** Evidence DeepSWE ~62% preview ; LiveCode ~82%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 50/100.** Paid $1.50/$6 per 1M preview.
- **Overall Score: 81/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (80+78+98+65+82)/5=80.6 → 81; best-fit per scoring methodology.

